{
  "_about": "Iceberg UI sound set 'Frost Glass' (E major glass taps). Files are pre-attenuated (peaks about -6.5 to -8 dBFS; hover -18) so they sit under game audio. 'gain' is the suggested extra playback gain (0..1) relative to a UI master of 1.0. Every name has .ogg (primary) and .mp3 (fallback) in this folder.",
